        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86721, Keaton Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keaton Refrigerator Pull is a modern rectangular pull that is well suited for transitional decors. It is available in a wide array of stylish finishes. The Keaton Appliance Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a 3/4 inch appliance panel--making it a great way to update your kitchen's refrigerator handle to show off your style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Keaton Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86721-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262383\"><b>Emtek Keaton Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86721:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86722:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
